{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-uppercase#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-uppercase","commit":"1a2abb566545bef59a894319997396f1ec51b71a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"大写转换是一个接入 DSH 工具接口的文本转换插件。插件在 DSH 的工具服务中注册 uppercase 工具，供会话调用。调用时传入一段 text 文本，工具会把输入内容转换为大写，并以 output 字段返回结果。它适合需要在会话中快速统一文本大小写、处理短文本或转换用户提供字符串的场景。实现直接使用 JavaScript 字符串的大写转换方法。代码没有读取 API 密钥，也没有配置或调用外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-16","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-uppercase#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-uppercase","commit":"1a2abb566545bef59a894319997396f1ec51b71a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"大写转换 is a DSH text tool. It registers an uppercase tool that accepts text and returns it converted to uppercase in an output field. Use it to change text casing during a session. The implementation uses JavaScript string uppercasing and reads no API keys or external service configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-16","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
